        {
          "group": "prompt_ordered_answers_key",
          "literal": {
            "prompt": "Какой натуральный материал одежды особенно известен ощущением прохлады?",
            "answers": [
              "Хлопок",
              "Лён",
              "Шёлк",
              "Шерсть"
            ],
            "correctIndex": 1
          },
          "literalSHA256": "78e63b1cb7ef688a0b375d7699a9f4ad6480c52011fea2f870ea9f21d8f70783",
          "primaryGround": "The noun entry defines linen as cloth made of flax and specifically notes its coolness; the prompt asks for this recognizable property, a different relation from the duplicated flax-stem origin questions.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion34/linen-context.json"
          ],
          "locator": "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion34/linen-context.json#/originalRecord/payload/output/1/text (L54-L62)",
          "sourcePathsBeforeTechnicalNormalization": [
            "/Users/eaafonasev/.codex/worktrees/question-quality-wave6-01a12b0f/mindbattle/docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion34/linen-context.json"
          ]
        },
        {
          "group": "explanation",
          "literal": "Льняную ткань делают изо льна; словарь отмечает её прочность, прохладу и блеск. Хлопковое волокно окружает семена хлопчатника, шёлк производят личинки насекомых, а шерсть представляет собой подшёрсток млекопитающих.",
          "literalSHA256": "ae568df5fa990d4b419973cf51ec235b1ea68b3b2a9a93dfd5350f0ae05cae54",
          "primaryGround": "The linen definition supplies flax origin, strength and coolness. Cotton is cotton-seed hair, silk is an insect-larva protein fibre, and wool is animal undercoat; the four options are natural clothing materials.",
          "sourcePaths": [
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion34/linen-context.json",
            "docs/content-audits/question-quality-wave-8/coordinator-01a17bfa/source-fashion31/mw-cotton.json",
